---
/* Dark-only site: force the theme, drop the light path entirely.

   Replaces Starlight's stock ThemeProvider, which picks `light` whenever
   localStorage or the OS prefers it. We force dark unconditionally, so a
   stale `starlight-theme=light` in a returning visitor's storage — or a
   light-mode OS — can't land them in the (retired) light theme. Inlined so it
   runs before first paint = no flash. StarlightThemeProvider is stubbed so any
   internal `updatePickers()` call no-ops (the toggle is removed too). */
---

<script is:inline>
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
</script>
